      "model_text": "Midjourney is a generative media platform developed and hosted by Midjourney, Inc. that creates visual media from natural language text prompts. The service allows users to generate, upscale, remix, and modify images either via its dedicated web interface or through commands in Discord. Documented platform features include prompt-based generation, region variation (inpainting), panning, style referencing, and character consistency controls.\nArtificial intelligence is the central, core functionality of Midjourney rather than an optional add-on. Documented capabilities center entirely on proprietary generative machine learning models (such as the Midjourney Image and Video model families) designed to parse user text inputs (prompts) and reference images to synthesize media. Additional documented generative features include parameter tuning, image remixing, style referencing (--sref), and character referencing (--cref).",
